    "millsfield:images_texts": [
      "TERMINAL BUILDING AT AIRPORT, KANSAS CITY, MO. 50",
      "31716N\nFive minutes by automobile from the down-\ntown business district is Kansas City's Municipal\nAirport with the fine terminal building pictured.\nThree airlines, Transcontinental and Western\nAir, Inc., Mid-Continent Airlines and Braniff\nAirways have fifty-four schedules in and out of\nKansas City daily-twenty-seven arrivals and\ntwenty-seven departures.\nPLACE\nSTAMP\nHERE\nPOST CARD\nA.\nBY\nE.\nKROPP CO.\nMILWAUKEE,\nwIS.\"\nPUB.\n•(CKY)\nBY\nR. B. HARNESS\nGREETING CARD CO., KANSAS CITY, MO.\n2015.166.20052"
    ],
